expanded_source_wording_tex:
\label{prop:d6-moves}
For a lawful D6 probe economy:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item allocation preserves active support and cannot activate a new probe;
  \item acquisition adds a catalog probe and requires
  \(\neg\mathsf{SameFamilySaturated}(L,M)\);
  \item retirement requires the probe to be active before the move and absent
  afterward; and
  \item same-family saturation prevents lawful strict acquisition in the Xi
  realization.
\end{enumerate}

