\label{cor:e16-route-capacity}
The landed declaration is
\begin{center}
\path|E16_RouteManufacturesRepairCapacity|.
\end{center}
It states that raw coherent-adaptability evidence for \(\chi\) supplies probability records
\(r_\gamma,r_\eta\) such that
\[
 r_\gamma.\mathsf{challengeClass}
 =r_\eta.\mathsf{challengeClass}=\chi.\mathsf{challengeClass},
 \qquad
 r_\gamma.\mathsf{probability}\ne r_\eta.\mathsf{probability}.
\]

